From: IT Support <postmaster@${DOMAIN_NAME}>
To: ${EMAIL}
Subject: Welcome to Your Corporate Mailbox - Configuration Guide & Storage Policy
Date: ${DATE}
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/html; charset=UTF-8

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Welcome to Your Corporate Mailbox</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 650px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
  <div style="background-color: #2b6cb0; color: #ffffff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 25px;">
    <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 22px;">Welcome to Your Corporate Email Account</h1>
    <p style="margin: 8px 0 0 0; opacity: 0.9;">Account setup instructions and mailbox policy</p>
  </div>

  <p>Dear ${ACCOUNT},</p>
  <p>Welcome! Your corporate email account has been successfully initialized. Below are your connection settings and mailbox storage details:</p>

  <h3 style="color: #2b6cb0; border-bottom: 2px solid #edf2f7; padding-bottom: 8px;">Storage Quota Information</h3>
  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 20px; background-color: #f7fafc; border-radius: 6px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 10px 15px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; font-weight: bold; width: 40%;">Allocated Quota:</td>
      <td style="padding: 10px 15px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; color: #2b6cb0; font-weight: bold;">${QUOTA_LIMIT}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 10px 15px; font-weight: bold;">Threshold Alert:</td>
      <td style="padding: 10px 15px;">Automated warning will be sent when storage reaches <strong>95%</strong>.</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <h3 style="color: #2b6cb0; border-bottom: 2px solid #edf2f7; padding-bottom: 8px;">Mail Server Connection Settings</h3>
  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 25px;">
    <tr style="background-color: #f7fafc;">
      <td style="padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; font-weight: bold;">Protocol</td>
      <td style="padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; font-weight: bold;">Server Address</td>
      <td style="padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; font-weight: bold;">Port / Security</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">IMAP (Incoming)</td>
      <td style="padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;"><code>${HOST_NAME}</code></td>
      <td style="padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">Port 993 (SSL/TLS)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">POP3 (Incoming)</td>
      <td style="padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;"><code>${HOST_NAME}</code></td>
      <td style="padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">Port 995 (SSL/TLS)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">SMTP (Outgoing)</td>
      <td style="padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;"><code>${HOST_NAME}</code></td>
      <td style="padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">Port 465 (SSL/TLS) / 587 (STARTTLS)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">Username</td>
      <td colspan="2" style="padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;"><code>${EMAIL}</code></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p>You can configure Microsoft Outlook, Mozilla Thunderbird, Apple Mail, or your mobile devices with the parameters above.</p>
  <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; margin: 25px 0 15px 0;">
  <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #718096; margin: 0;">IT Infrastructure Team | System Generated Notification</p>
</body>
</html>
